<ecoSpold xmlns="http://www.EcoInvent.org/EcoSpold02">
  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e40b7e21-3112-5f10-821c-2743bcfe6b22" activityNameId="93ccc262-5e05-5366-a4f5-fb942178d021" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, maintenance, road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, maintenance, road
Data on the land use of roads is further distinguished between road network and road embankements.  Material consumption due to road renewal are not included. The consumption of these materials are included in the module "road";
UUID: 876f8f6b-9548-3edc-84b6-a4b0b05e90c6
The inventory includes processes such as: de icing with salt, marking of lines and weed control. Energy consumption for lighting of roads and tunnels and ventilation of tunnels has been estimated. Further more, land occupation and transformation are included.
Location: Data refers to average conditions in Switzerland. For de icing activities, a recent Austrian has been applied.
Technology: Swiss state of the art technology
Time period: Road lenght is based on current statistical data (2000). The included processes represent a situation in the early 1990ties. The road and embakement area are based on a study from 1995 and have been modufied with current road infrastructure data. Road lenght is based on current statistical data (2000). 
Production volume: na
Sampling: national statistics, data  published in literature and expert estimates 
Extrapolations: for de icing, data from Austria have been employed.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_876f8f6b-9548-3edc-84b6-a4b0b05e90c6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Data refers to average conditions in Switzerland. For de icing activities, a recent Austrian has been applied.</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
