        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2000-01-01" endDate="2000-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Time period: Road lenght is based on current statistical data (2000). The included processes represent a situation in the early 1990ties. The road and embakement area are based on a study from 1995 and have been modufied with current road infrastructure data. Road lenght is based on current statistical data (2000). </text>
        </comment>
      </timePeriod>
